Subject: [PATCH 174/206] ASoC: dt-bindings: awinic,aw88395: Add AW88271

The AW88271 is a boosted Smart K amplifier without a DSP, from the
same family as the AW88081 and AW88083. The Jolla Phone (2026) has two
of them. Their reset lines are held low by the bootloader, so unlike the
AW88081 and AW88083 the binding lets the AW88271 name its reset GPIO.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
index b9abb1094..99617e70b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
       - awinic,aw88083
       - awinic,aw88166
       - awinic,aw88261
+      - awinic,aw88271
       - awinic,aw88395
       - awinic,aw88399
 
